   - Custom pointer-capture-based drag/resize (no native HTML drag-drop for node manipulation; native HTML5 drag-and-drop IS used for OS file drops)
   - Spatial-only "containment" (no formal parent/child links) for group-drag-carries-children and no-fly-zone placement logic
   - CSS custom properties for theming (`--paper`, `--ink`, `--surface`, `--border-soft`, `--outline`, `--border-static`, Nord palette), light/dark via `data-theme` attribute
